Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=32}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.34,0:01:54.51,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.51,0:01:58.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}At daybreak, the pirates will be landing\Nat this shore to begin their attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.81,0:02:03.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}But the only way that they'll be able\Nto get to the village is to go up this slope.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.31,0:02:07.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2\an8}The rest of the shoreline is sheer cliffs,\Nso they have to come through here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.94,0:02:10.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If we can fight them while they're\Nfunneled into that narrow pass,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.36,0:02:13.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,their numbers won't mean anything\Nand the village will be protected.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.07,0:02:14.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Alright, sounds pretty easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.66,0:02:17.28,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,Talking about it is,\Nbut victory depends on our strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.95,0:02:19.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is it that\Nyou guys can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.37,0:02:20.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1197,1053)}I cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.24,0:02:21.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(712,1053)}I stretch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.16,0:02:22.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(235,1053)}I steal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.29,0:02:23.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.50,0:02:25.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, this time\Nyou'd better fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.88,0:02:28.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just making a funny.\NC'mon, calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.22,0:02:33.34,Main-207-,Merry,0,0,0,,Ah, Klahadore.\NWelcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.34,0:02:34.63,Main-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,How is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.63,0:02:36.18,Main-207-,Merry,0,0,0,,She's resting just now.\NShe was quite exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.81,0:02:42.68,Main-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,I leave town for a few hours\Nto tend to some errands,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.68,0:02:44.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and everything falls to pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.52,0:02:47.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That Usopp certainly knows how\Nto cause trouble, doesn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.36,0:02:48.27,Main-207-,Merry,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.27,0:02:52.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}And on top of everything else he's done\Ntoday, he claimed you were a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.53,0:02:55.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha! I can't think\Nof a more outrageous lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.95,0:02:57.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.16,0:03:05.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's this here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.54,0:03:06.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, that's\Na present of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.96,0:03:09.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,From Miss Kaya\Nto you, Klahadore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.50,0:03:11.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's been three years\Nsince you came to this mansion,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.84,0:03:14.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and this gift is to say\Nthank you for your hard work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.72,0:03:16.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a commemoration of sorts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.09,0:03:17.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.43,0:03:20.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}The glasses you're wearing are always\Nslipping and you have to push them back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.93,0:03:23.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, the lady of the house custom\Nordered a new pair for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.43,0:03:27.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Isn't she just the most thoughtful\Nyoung woman you've ever met?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.56,0:03:30.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How appropriate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.48,0:03:34.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow will be a day\Nworth commemorating.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.12,0:03:43.37,Main-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,It's a crescent moon tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.37,0:03:44.70,Main-207-,Merry,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.70,0:03:49.38,Main-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,It's on nights\Nlike these that I truly feel alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.38,0:03:52.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My heart races, and my blood\Nboils in my veins.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.76,0:03:55.51,Main-207-,Merry,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.51,0:03:57.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Klahadore,\Nwhat're you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.38,0:04:01.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why would you do such a thing\Nto Miss Kaya's present?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.26,0:04:03.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'll be receiving\Na gift all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.72,0:04:06.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But it won't be glasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.43,0:04:08.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It'll be her entire estate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.77,0:04:12.02,Main-207-,Merry,0,0,0,,What're\Nyou saying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.02,0:04:15.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I suppose there's no reason\Nto carry on the act any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.40,0:04:20.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In a few hours, the village will be\Nmourning the unforeseen tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.49,0:04:27.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Three long years\NI've quietly waited for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.25,0:04:30.96,Main-207-,Merry,0,0,0,,Miss! You have\Nto get out of here! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.02,0:04:50.02,Main-207-,Pirate A,0,0,0,,Captain Jango!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.35,0:04:54.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Captain Jango, it's almost\Ndaybreak, it's time get moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.73,0:04:58.36,Main-207-,Pirate B,0,0,0,,Good morning, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.36,0:04:59.20,Main-207-,Pirate C,0,0,0,,Good morning, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.66,0:05:01.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.82,0:05:04.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Only the sun can wake me up\Nand live to tell about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.78,0:05:06.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do I make myself clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.54,0:05:08.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's in a really bad mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.04,0:05:10.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mornings are the worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.00,0:05:14.21,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,Just look, the moon is still up,\Nso the sun couldn't have woken me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.21,0:05:16.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, which one of you did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.21,0:05:18.51,Main-207-,Pirates,0,0,0,,Our apologies, sir!\NWe're very sorry, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.09,0:05:24.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Good morning, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.72,0:05:26.39,Main-207-,Pirate D,0,0,0,,Wait,\Nwhat's goin' on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.39,0:05:27.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He was mad just\Na second ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.93,0:05:29.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So what? He's\Nin a better mood now
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.52,0:05:31.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and that's all that matters\Nso keep your big trap shut!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.24,0:05:33.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Attention, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.56,0:05:35.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's set sail!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.24,0:05:44.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yep, I'm a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.70,0:05:47.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no way they'll be able\Nto make it up this slope now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.66,0:05:51.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}All this oil we put here should keep them\Noccupied while we go to work on 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.66,0:05:54.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're gonna be busy slipping and\Nsliding around like a bunch of idiots,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.38,0:05:57.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,728)}then we show up and beat\Nthe crap out of 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.71,0:05:59.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wow, so that's\Nyour plan, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.38,0:06:00.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.34,0:06:02.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm going to defend the village\Nno matter what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.93,0:06:06.18,Main-207-,Nami,0,0,0,,{\q2}Let's just hope none of us slip\Non that oil and end up down there with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.18,0:06:08.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Because that would be like\Nsliding into a meat grinder.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.93,0:06:12.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp, I gotta hand it to you,\Nyou're pretty good at fighting dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.85,0:06:14.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Of course I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.27,0:06:17.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There isn't anyone alive who\Ncan best me with a sling shot,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.15,0:06:19.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,or beat me at the art\Nof fighting dirty!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.28,0:06:25.70,Main-207-,Zoro,0,0,0,,It's almost daybreak.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.26,0:06:27.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.38,0:06:46.89,Main-207-,Pirate A,0,0,0,,We're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.89,0:06:48.93,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,Alright, men!\NYou know what to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.93,0:06:52.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go ashore! Trash the village!\NHead for the mansion!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.52,0:06:53.89,Main-207-,Pirates,0,0,0,,Aye, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.89,0:06:56.65,Main-207-,Pirate F,0,0,0,,Captain, there\Nare already two boats here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.65,0:06:58.65,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.65,0:07:00.07,Main-207-,Pirate F,0,0,0,,Shall I investigate?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.07,0:07:01.32,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,Leave 'em for later.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.32,0:07:04.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}They don't look like treasure ships\Nto me and we have a schedule to keep.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.03,0:07:07.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.66,0:07:09.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I thought we\Nwere gonna fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.16,0:07:11.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The sun's up. What's the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.12,0:07:14.12,Main-207-,Zoro,0,0,0,,Huh...\NMaybe they over slept.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.67,0:07:19.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,980)}Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.96,0:07:24.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Maybe I'm hearing things, but it sounds\Nlike battle cries from somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.14,0:07:32.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I definitely hear them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.06,0:07:33.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, it can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.81,0:07:35.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What can't be?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.64,0:07:37.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's a shore just\Nlike this to the north!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.77,0:07:40.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They went...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.56,0:07:43.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're at the wrong shore?!\NThat's not good!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.32,0:07:47.61,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\q2}Well, this is where they had\Ntheir secret meeting so I just assumed okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.11,0:07:49.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We need to hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.24,0:07:51.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Before they make it\Nto the village! Where is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.83,0:07:53.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You have to head\Ndirectly north from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.62,0:07:55.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you run you, could make it\Nin three minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.83,0:07:57.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The terrain there is almost\Nexactly the same,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.62,0:08:00.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so all we need to do is stop\Nthem at the slope.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.92,0:08:03.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.05,0:08:07.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}If those filthy pirates are at the north shore,\Nthen they've already seen our boats!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.01,0:08:08.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They'll take our treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.43,0:08:10.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll be there in twenty seconds!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.43,0:08:11.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aw, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.80,0:08:15.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My brilliant oil strategy\Nwas all for nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.14,0:08:16.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My precious treasure...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.98,0:08:17.69,Main-207-,Zoro,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.69,0:08:19.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What're you doing?\NLet's get outta here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.35,0:08:20.31,Main-207-,Nami,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.03,0:08:26.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Help! I'm gonna fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.86,0:08:28.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let go, you moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.15,0:08:30.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.03,0:08:31.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.37,0:08:32.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,See ya there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.04,0:08:40.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but you understand,\Nthe treasure's in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.88,0:08:43.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That oil won't be\Na problem for you, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.84,0:08:45.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That girl's gonna pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.93,0:08:53.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I swear on my life, they'll\Nnever set foot in my village!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.18,0:08:56.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That Luffy sure\Nis a good runner.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.10,0:08:58.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's so far ahead,\NI can't even see him anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.35,0:09:00.81,Main-207-,Luffy,0,0,0,,Run straight north!\NRun straight north!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.81,0:09:03.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Run straight north!\NRun straight north!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.86,0:09:07.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Those mongrels are in big trouble if\Nthey so much as look at my treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.74,0:09:17.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's an ambush!\NSomebody's up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.83,0:09:21.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.34,0:09:35.85,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\q2}I am the legendary Captain Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.85,0:09:38.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.10,0:09:45.61,Thoughts-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,I wasn't supposed\Nto be the first one here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.61,0:09:49.65,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,He was running way ahead of me.\NI can't handle these guys alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.95,0:09:54.74,Main-207-,Zoro,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.74,0:09:57.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed\Nto get past this stuff?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.58,0:10:04.04,Main-207-,Luffy,0,0,0,,The village...\NThat can't be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.42,0:10:08.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}He said run north and I ran in a cold-ish direction\Nso I should be at the shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.59,0:10:15.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's you. I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.43,0:10:18.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're one of the troublesome brats\Nwho overheard our plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.35,0:10:19.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What do you think\Nyou're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.68,0:10:21.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm warning you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.06,0:10:23.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Leave here while you still can!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.10,0:10:27.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you don't, my 100 million crewmen\Nwill massacre all of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.78,0:10:30.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,100 million?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.69,0:10:33.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are we really supposed\Nto believe that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.24,0:10:36.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No way! 100 million!\NIncredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.41,0:10:38.33,Main-207-,Pirate I,0,0,0,,Captain!\NHe's obviously lying!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.33,0:10:40.33,Main-207-,Pirate J,0,0,0,,Then it's time\Nto call his bluff.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.33,0:10:41.75,Thoughts-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,They saw through it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.75,0:10:44.62,Main-207-,Pirate K,0,0,0,,That guy seriously\Nthought he could fool us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.62,0:10:47.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's that?! You've been\Nlying to us this whole time?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.92,0:10:49.80,Main-207-,Pirate L,0,0,0,,Captain Jango,\Ntake a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.80,0:10:50.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh no, is it bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.84,0:10:52.01,Main-207-,Pirate L,0,0,0,,No, sir! It's good!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.63,0:10:55.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We searched those other ships\Nand found a huge load of treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.13,0:10:58.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's hard to say how much, but I bet\Nit's around five million berries!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.47,0:11:00.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.31,0:11:02.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Five million berries?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.68,0:11:06.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How in the world did those guys get\Nahold of so much treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.61,0:11:09.77,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,I see\Nyou found my loot!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.36,0:11:11.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, you can have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.40,0:11:13.82,Main-207-,Pirate K,0,0,0,,You're just gonna\Nlet us take your treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.82,0:11:15.70,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.70,0:11:19.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just turn around and forget all about\Nthis place and the treasure is yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.58,0:11:22.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I didn't think people\Nthat stupid actually existed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.83,0:11:26.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,At this point, he's just\Nembarrassing himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.33,0:11:29.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay, do you know\Nwhat a pirate is?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.21,0:11:33.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're going to take this treasure and\Nthere's nothing you can do about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.09,0:11:37.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And there is no way we're turning\Nback until we get what we came for.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.76,0:11:40.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.89,0:11:43.14,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,Alright, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.14,0:11:47.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,On the count of "one, two,\NJango," you'll let us by.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.56,0:11:49.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's that strange\Nweapon from before.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.90,0:11:52.15,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}One, two!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.15,0:11:52.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)}Jan...!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.28,0:11:56.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't you ever try to give\Nmy hard-earned treasure away!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.37,0:12:01.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My head!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.24,0:12:03.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Hey! Who is this crazy girl?!\N– Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.33,0:12:05.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This isn't the time\Nto be hypnotizing yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.25,0:12:07.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we got a mission\Nto carry out, remember?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.29,0:12:08.25,Main-207-,Nami,0,0,0,,That treasure boat is mine
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.08,0:12:11.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and I'm not gonna let\Nyou have a single berry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.25,0:12:13.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do ya hear me? In fact\Nyou better clear out,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.42,0:12:15.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,'cause I'm coming down\Nthere to get it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.42,0:12:16.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That really hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.42,0:12:18.05,Main-207-,Nami,0,0,0,,Who said you could\Ngive them {\i1}my{\i0} treasure?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.05,0:12:19.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You got what you deserve!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.39,0:12:23.14,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,I didn't give them the treasure,\NI just said I would give it to them!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.14,0:12:24.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's the same thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.27,0:12:26.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And I just saved your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.64,0:12:31.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I guess I forgot to mention it to ya\Nearlier, don't ever watch his ring routine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.11,0:12:34.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That weirdo's a hypnotist.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.02,0:12:35.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hypnotist?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.65,0:12:36.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, where's Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.99,0:12:39.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's a fast runner, I thought\Nhe'd be here way ahead of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.91,0:12:43.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I don't know. He either got lost\Nor he chickened out at the last minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.62,0:12:46.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The only thing that\Ncould keep him from a fight
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.33,0:12:48.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,is getting lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.08,0:12:49.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Right when we need him, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.62,0:12:51.38,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,I'll go ahead\Nand take command here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.38,0:12:53.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think it's about time\Nyou go 'n kick their butts!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.46,0:12:55.96,Main-207-,Nami,0,0,0,,What?! Me?!\NWhat about you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.96,0:12:58.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't take on a boatload\Nof vicious pirates by myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.34,0:12:59.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's just suicide!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.72,0:13:01.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What? Like I'm gonna do\Nany fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.47,0:13:05.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Beneath this calm exterior lies\Nthe abject terror of a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.18,0:13:06.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, so you think\Nyou're scared?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.97,0:13:09.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm so scared I am\Nliterally about to cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.94,0:13:12.02,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,Please!\NYour eyes are completely dry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.02,0:13:13.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You'll have to do\Nbetter than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.15,0:13:14.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Liars can smell their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.44,0:13:16.19,Main-207-,Nami,0,0,0,,That's just\Nyour upper lip!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.23,0:13:17.19,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\an8}I got beat up by...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.98,0:13:20.57,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,We don't have time\Nfor this nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.57,0:13:22.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Alright, men,\Nlet's get to work!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.28,0:13:24.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Crush them and move\Nto the village!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.12,0:13:29.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Here they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.62,0:13:32.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait! I know!\NI have some caltrops!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.17,0:13:34.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Those are just what\Nthe doctor ordered!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.21,0:13:35.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Lemme have some!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.76,0:13:40.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're gonna love this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.26,0:13:41.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)}Caltrop!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.22,0:13:43.22,Main-207-,Both,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,150)}Hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.73,0:13:56.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami... if you're still alive when I get\Noutta here, I'm gonna kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.95,0:14:06.66,Main-207-,Zoro,0,0,0,,Take that, oil!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.79,0:14:16.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now... how do I get\Nto the north shore from here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.50,0:14:19.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Run straight north!\NRun straight north!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.55,0:14:21.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Run straight nor...!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.30,0:14:28.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But which way is north?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.10,0:14:34.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes! We got 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.40,0:14:38.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Check it out! Here\Ncomes... the Lead Star!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.15,0:14:42.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.32,0:14:45.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Way to go! You're\Nquite the warrior after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.16,0:14:47.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Looks like you got this handled\Nso I'll just take a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.37,0:14:49.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But you haven't done\Nanything yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.91,0:14:51.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.62,0:14:53.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There are caltrops behind us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.91,0:14:56.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Idiot! {\i1}You{\i0} dropped\Nthose things behind us, too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.84,0:14:59.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get outta the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.89,0:15:11.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha. Don't tell me you really thought\Nyou were going to stop us down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.31,0:15:17.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's go, fellas!\NCaptain Kuro hates waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.03,0:15:24.28,Main-207-,Pirate M,0,0,0,,You again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.28,0:15:27.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let go of me, you jackass!\NYou want some more?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.57,0:15:30.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Here! Have some!\NHave a little more!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.33,0:15:36.58,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,I will never... let\Nyou step foot in that village!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.79,0:15:40.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All I did was lie\Nlike I always do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.05,0:15:44.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,See...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.47,0:15:47.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Today will be like every other day\Nin that sleepy little town,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.30,0:15:50.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,'cause you and your cronies\Nwill never set foot in it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.97,0:15:52.18,Main-207-,Pirate O,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.81,0:15:57.39,Main-207-,Pirate I,0,0,0,,Stupid girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.94,0:16:02.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Treasure...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.77,0:16:03.86,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,Are you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.78,0:16:08.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shut up! I won't\Ntell you again!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.82,0:16:12.45,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,We've wasted\Nenough time playing pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.45,0:16:15.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Quit bothering with them\Nand move to the village!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.25,0:16:18.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Or have you forgotten\Nthat this is Captain Kuro's operation?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.33,0:16:22.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And he doesn't look favorably on his\Nwell laid plans being ruined by idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.75,0:16:24.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He'll kill us all!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.17,0:16:25.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You understand\Nthat, you cretins?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.96,0:16:26.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.72,0:16:28.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Let's get to the village!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.89,0:16:36.06,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,Don't go any further.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.06,0:16:38.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I said stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.31,0:16:40.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Turn back. Don't take\Nanother step.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.77,0:16:42.02,Main-207-,Pirate F,0,0,0,,Get off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.95,0:16:51.95,Thoughts-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,Please,\Ndon't kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.95,0:16:55.87,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Just leave this village alone.\NThey're good people.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.45,0:16:58.29,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,They don't deserve this.\NI love this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.79,0:17:01.42,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.77,0:17:19.31,Main-207-,Pirate G,0,0,0,,What is this,\NCaptain Jango?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.31,0:17:21.90,Main-207-,Pirate M,0,0,0,,Nobody told us that killers\Nlike those were gonna be here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.94,0:17:24.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's about time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.78,0:17:30.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is that the best\Nthose pirates can dish out?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.45,0:17:33.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I was hopin'\Nfor a challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.87,0:17:34.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.53,0:17:37.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,After leaving me down there, you're\Nlucky I'm not kickin' your butt too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.58,0:17:39.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp, you big bonehead!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.41,0:17:42.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You never told me\Nwhich direction was north!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.04,0:17:45.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who are these guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.34,0:17:53.68,Main-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,They're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.68,0:17:57.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't appreciate\Ntardiness. Not one bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.22,0:18:02.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}They know full well what happens to those\Nwho are foolish enough to upset my plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.78,0:18:11.40,Main-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,Do they think they\Ncan take their sweet time?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.40,0:18:14.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, if they have forgotten the\Nconsequences of disappointing me...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.91,0:18:18.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll kill them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.01,0:18:31.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.76,0:18:34.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That was great. You guys\Nare really that strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.43,0:18:37.39,Main-207-,Luffy,0,0,0,,Mh-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.39,0:18:40.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Could you have been slower?\NWhat took you so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.68,0:18:42.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're{\i0} the one\Nwho pushed me down
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.52,0:18:44.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that oil slick\Nso you could get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.39,0:18:47.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It was an accident.\NI slipped, you fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.36,0:18:48.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,At least one of us made\Nit outta there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.86,0:18:51.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's better than both of us\Nbeing stuck at the bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.65,0:18:53.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It shoulda just been {\i1}you{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.70,0:18:55.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,"Run straight north!" he says.\NThat's just great!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.99,0:18:59.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I mean, how am I supposed to know\Nwhich way north even is out here, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.66,0:19:03.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Shut up. {\i1}You're{\i0} the one who ran away\Nso sure of yourself, ready to take on anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.29,0:19:07.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, I just got so excited,\NI started running, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.17,0:19:09.71,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,The sun rises high\Nin the sky now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.71,0:19:13.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And that means, Captain Kuro\Ngrows very impatient.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.55,0:19:16.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Men, don't just lie there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.22,0:19:18.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can't tell me\Nyou're going to let them win.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.47,0:19:20.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're just a couple of idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.52,0:19:29.61,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,The fact, is we don't have time\Nto lollygag around here any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.19,0:19:33.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If our enemy is strong, then\Nwe must become stronger than them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.57,0:19:35.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Here, stare deeply\Ninto this ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.78,0:19:39.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, I will count "one, two,\NJango" and after that,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.41,0:19:41.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you will all begin\Nto grow stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.20,0:19:44.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your wounds will heal and you\Nwill grow stronger still.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.20,0:19:46.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, what is he doing?\NIt looks weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.75,0:19:48.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Looks like hypnosis.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.21,0:19:50.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's trying to convince them\Nthey're stronger than they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.59,0:19:52.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Like that'll work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.17,0:19:54.30,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}One... Two...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.30,0:19:56.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Jango!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.97,0:20:01.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.48,0:20:17.15,Main-207-,Zoro,0,0,0,,That one guy\Ncompletely destroyed the cliff!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.15,0:20:19.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now that's what I call power.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.66,0:20:22.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I always thought hypnotizing people\Nwas a buncha crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.62,0:20:23.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That was just one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.91,0:20:26.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Imagine what\Nthe whole crew can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.54,0:20:29.79,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,Now go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.79,0:20:31.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And strike down all\Nwho stand in your way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.26,0:20:45.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys,\Nyou might wanna move.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.39,0:20:48.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy. You and I will take\Nit from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.19,0:20:53.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Alright then, what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.32,0:20:58.24,Main-207-,Zoro,0,0,0,,Uhh... Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.16,0:21:05.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you let\Nthat freak hypnotize you too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.33,0:21:14.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ugh. He really is\Na simple-minded idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.96,0:21:17.30,Main-207-,Luffy,0,0,0,,Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.05,0:21:21.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.55,0:21:26.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gatling!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.32,0:21:36.86,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,Damn you,\NCaptain Kuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.86,0:21:40.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You made one hell\Nof a miscalculation.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.28,0:21:42.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,These are not your\Naverage village idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.55,0:22:04.55,Main-207-,Zoro,0,0,0,,Where's he going?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.89,0:22:08.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.65,0:22:20.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right! Tear it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.74,0:22:25.62,Main-207-,Pirate B,0,0,0,,Ah!\NHe's gonna destroy our ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.83,0:22:36.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.00,0:22:38.63,Main-207-,Pirate B,0,0,0,,He's gonna crush\Nus with it! Everybody run!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.63,0:22:42.51,Main-207-,Pirate C,0,0,0,,Captain,\Ndo something!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.76,0:22:48.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,One, two, Jango!\NYou will fall asleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.27,0:22:55.65,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}One, two, Jango!
Comment: 0,0:23:16.43,0:23:18.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{AUDIO REVIEW: Possible "Do something!" amid pirates yelling; repeated speech-transcription passes disagree. Confirm exact words before enabling.}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.55,0:23:32.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Looks like those guys are probably\Ndown for the count, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.18,0:23:33.22,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,I guess. Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.43,0:23:36.69,Main-207-,Nami,0,0,0,,But Luffy's still\Ntrapped underneath that cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.69,0:23:37.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just look.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.19,0:23:39.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Relax. He's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.69,0:23:43.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}You should really worry\Nabout your own injuries by the looks of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.40,0:23:45.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn that little brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.90,0:23:47.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now our whole plan's shot to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.86,0:23:50.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What am I gonna do\Nwith this mess?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.49,0:23:55.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Captain Kuro sees this\Nand he'll kill us!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.83,0:23:58.50,Main-207-,Siam,0,0,0,,Butchie!\NCome check this out!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.50,0:24:00.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's some bad stuff\Ngoing down.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.84,0:24:03.25,Main-207-,Butchie,0,0,0,,What the hell?!
